{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55637","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十五 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"任运腾腾无所依，闲游长坐性怡怡。\n疎林不遣闲人到，密意多应夜月知。\n骤雨过时苔路滑，拨云行处石桥危。\n尘沙劫尽清风在，何假虚名上古碑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}